+     * user never clicked may not be given focus at all by a window manager that prevents
+     * focus stealing. Ask for it, or the cursor escapes on every game start and exit and
+     * the guest stops seeing the mouse -- docs/LOG.md [379].
+     */
+    SDL_RaiseWindow(scon->real_window);
